---

<section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 bg-muted/50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      {/* Eyebrow */}
      <div class="mb-8">
        <span class="inline-block text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">
          One Framework. Many Industries.
        </span>
      </div>

      {/* Section Heading */}
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 leading-tight">
        A common foundation across industries.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-12">
        From energy infrastructure to manufacturing facilities and construction projects, the challenge
        remains the same: managing complex systems and the information surrounding them.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-16">
        The ISO/IEC 81346 series combines general structuring principles with industry-specific
        classification frameworks, enabling organizations to apply a consistent methodology to their
        engineering environments.
      </p>

      {/* Industries Grid */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
        {/* Power & Energy */}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-3 p-6 rounded-lg bg-background border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Power & Energy</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Structure generation, supply, distribution, and supporting technical systems.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Construction & Infrastructure */}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-3 p-6 rounded-lg bg-background border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Construction & Infrastructure</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Organize buildings, facilities, utilities, and their interconnected systems.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Manufacturing & Process */}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-3 p-6 rounded-lg bg-background border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Manufacturing & Process Industries</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Create consistent structures for production systems, machinery, and industrial equipment.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Complex Technical */}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-3 p-6 rounded-lg bg-background border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Complex Technical Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Establish clear relationships between systems, subsystems, and components across engineering
            disciplines.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
